									<div class=3D"tile-boc-copy typography-body-elevated">
										<p>With <span class=3D"highlight">Apple&nbsp;Music Sing</span>, y=
ou and your friends can sing along to millions of songs.<sup class=3D"footn=
ote footnote-number"><a href=3D"https://www.apple.com/apple-music/#footnote=
-12" aria-label=3D"Footnote 9" data-modal-close=3D"">9</a></sup> Real-time =
lyrics animate to the rhythm of the music =E2=80=94 and translations with p=
ronunciations let you belt out songs in their original language.<sup class=
=3D"footnote footnote-number"><a href=3D"https://www.apple.com/apple-music/=
#footnote-13" aria-label=3D"Footnote 10" data-modal-close=3D"">10</a></sup>=
 <span class=3D"highlight">Adjustable vocals</span> let you take the lead o=
r sing backup. Duet view shows the vocalists=E2=80=99 verses on opposite si=
des of the screen, so it=E2=80=99s easy to stay in sync. And now your iPhon=
e doubles as a microphone<sup class=3D"footnote footnote-number"><a href=3D=
"https://www.apple.com/apple-music/#footnote-14" aria-label=3D"Footnote 11"=
 data-modal-close=3D"">11</a></sup> =E2=80=94 pair it with Apple&nbsp;TV to=
 bring the party to the big screen.</p>
